The first thing to be done after creating an EntraID tenant is to secure it. 
It is critical to ensure that the tenant created is secured and has security policies put into place to prevent cyberattacks. 

First we will go to the Entra Admin Center -> Overview and verify the following:
  The tenant name
  The primary domain (onmicrosoft.com)
  The Tenant ID 

You can also add a company domain by going to Identity -> Settings -> Custom domain names
  From here you will add the domain
  Verify that you are the domain owner via DNS TXT record
  Set this as the primary domain
